# === Sensitive material — never commit ===
# Per-installation Bambu state lives in ~/.x2d (outside the repo); these patterns
# are defence-in-depth in case any of it is ever copied in-tree.
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
.x2d/
**/credentials
**/cloud_session.json
**/printer_sign_key.pem
**/printer_device_cert.pem
**/captured_project_file.json
**/printer_last_task.json
*token*.json
*captured*.json
*project_file*.json
